{"memory_key": "m01", "id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000000001", "logical_id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000001001", "revision": 1, "supersedes_id": null, "status": "active", "scope": "global", "project_id": null, "memory_type": "decision", "content": "Reproducible compiler archives use SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH=1700000000 and sort member paths by UTF-8 byte order before writing the archive.", "tags": [], "identifiers": ["SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH"], "source_ref": "SRC-COMP-ARCHIVE"}
{"memory_key": "m02", "id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000000002", "logical_id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000001002", "revision": 1, "supersedes_id": null, "status": "active", "scope": "global", "project_id": null, "memory_type": "procedure", "content": "The compiler wrapper rewrites only debug-file paths with --remap-path-prefix=/work=/src; it must not rewrite paths embedded in diagnostic messages.", "tags": [], "identifiers": ["--remap-path-prefix"], "source_ref": "SRC-COMP-PATHS"}
{"memory_key": "m03", "id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000000003", "logical_id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000001003", "revision": 1, "supersedes_id": null, "status": "active", "scope": "global", "project_id": null, "memory_type": "policy", "content": "GeoJSON exchanged with field tools is WGS 84 and every position is [longitude, latitude]; altitude is omitted rather than represented by null.", "tags": [], "identifiers": ["GeoJSON", "WGS 84"], "source_ref": "SRC-GEO-EXCHANGE"}
{"memory_key": "m04", "id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000000004", "logical_id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000001004", "revision": 1, "supersedes_id": null, "status": "active", "scope": "global", "project_id": null, "memory_type": "decision", "content": "The surveying import stores projected coordinates as easting,northing in EPSG:25833. Conversion to geographic coordinates happens only at the exchange boundary.", "tags": [], "identifiers": ["EPSG:25833"], "source_ref": "SRC-GEO-SURVEY"}
{"memory_key": "m05", "id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000000005", "logical_id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000001005", "revision": 1, "supersedes_id": null, "status": "active", "scope": "global", "project_id": null, "memory_type": "procedure", "content": "For Arabic specimen text, shape after assigning script=Arab and language=ar; apply the required rlig feature before optional stylistic-set features.", "tags": [], "identifiers": ["script=Arab", "rlig"], "source_ref": "SRC-FONT-SHAPING"}
{"memory_key": "m06", "id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000000006", "logical_id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000001006", "revision": 1, "supersedes_id": null, "status": "active", "scope": "global", "project_id": null, "memory_type": "decision", "content": "Document rendering pins the variable-font optical-size axis to opsz=14 when no CSS font-optical-sizing value is supplied, so hosts do not choose different defaults.", "tags": [], "identifiers": ["opsz=14", "font-optical-sizing"], "source_ref": "SRC-FONT-VARIABLE"}
{"memory_key": "m07", "id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000000007", "logical_id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000001007", "revision": 1, "supersedes_id": null, "status": "active", "scope": "global", "project_id": null, "memory_type": "policy", "content": "Outbound distributed-tracing headers use W3C traceparent version 00 with lowercase hexadecimal: a 32-hex trace ID and 16-hex parent ID.", "tags": [], "identifiers": ["traceparent", "W3C"], "source_ref": "SRC-TRACE-WIRE"}
{"memory_key": "m08", "id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000000008", "logical_id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000001008", "revision": 1, "supersedes_id": null, "status": "active", "scope": "global", "project_id": null, "memory_type": "policy", "content": "The tracing gateway removes baggage entries whose key begins user. before export; trace IDs remain intact for correlation.", "tags": [], "identifiers": ["baggage", "user."], "source_ref": "SRC-TRACE-PRIVACY"}
{"memory_key": "m09", "id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000000009", "logical_id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000001009", "revision": 1, "supersedes_id": null, "status": "active", "scope": "global", "project_id": null, "memory_type": "procedure", "content": "Laboratory concentration summaries aggregate unrounded Decimal values and quantize the final displayed result with ROUND_HALF_EVEN to three decimal places.", "tags": [], "identifiers": ["ROUND_HALF_EVEN", "Decimal"], "source_ref": "SRC-DECIMAL-SUMMARY"}
{"memory_key": "m10", "id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000000010", "logical_id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000001010", "revision": 1, "supersedes_id": null, "status": "active", "scope": "global", "project_id": null, "memory_type": "decision", "content": "Raw pressure readings are stored as Decimal with scale 6; the scale is a storage constraint, not a display precision rule.", "tags": [], "identifiers": ["scale 6", "pressure"], "source_ref": "SRC-DECIMAL-STORAGE"}
{"memory_key": "m11", "id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000000011", "logical_id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000001011", "revision": 1, "supersedes_id": null, "status": "active", "scope": "global", "project_id": null, "memory_type": "procedure", "content": "When parsing an ambiguous Europe/Berlin local timestamp from manual entry, reject it unless the caller supplies fold=0 or fold=1.", "tags": [], "identifiers": ["Europe/Berlin", "fold"], "source_ref": "SRC-TIME-MANUAL"}
{"memory_key": "m12", "id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000000012", "logical_id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000001012", "revision": 1, "supersedes_id": null, "status": "active", "scope": "global", "project_id": null, "memory_type": "policy", "content": "The legacy meter import interprets an ambiguous America/New_York wall time as fold=1, the later occurrence, and records that assumption in its import note.", "tags": [], "identifiers": ["America/New_York", "fold=1"], "source_ref": "SRC-TIME-IMPORT"}
{"memory_key": "m13", "id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000000013", "logical_id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000001013", "revision": 1, "supersedes_id": null, "status": "active", "scope": "global", "project_id": null, "memory_type": "policy", "content": "User-visible labels are normalized to Unicode NFC at the write boundary. Do not apply NFKC because it can collapse intentionally distinct symbols.", "tags": [], "identifiers": ["NFC", "NFKC"], "source_ref": "SRC-UNICODE-LABELS"}
{"memory_key": "m14", "id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000000014", "logical_id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000001014", "revision": 1, "supersedes_id": null, "status": "active", "scope": "global", "project_id": null, "memory_type": "procedure", "content": "Asset filenames retain their original code points for display, but duplicate detection compares NFC-normalized names within one directory.", "tags": [], "identifiers": ["NFC", "filenames"], "source_ref": "SRC-UNICODE-ASSETS"}
{"memory_key": "m15", "id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000000015", "logical_id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000001015", "revision": 1, "supersedes_id": null, "status": "active", "scope": "global", "project_id": null, "memory_type": "decision", "content": "The sensor envelope is TLV. Readers skip unknown optional tags and preserve their raw bytes when rewriting an envelope, enabling forward-compatible relays.", "tags": [], "identifiers": ["TLV", "unknown optional tags"], "source_ref": "SRC-BIN-TLV"}
{"memory_key": "m16", "id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000000016", "logical_id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000001016", "revision": 1, "supersedes_id": null, "status": "active", "scope": "global", "project_id": null, "memory_type": "policy", "content": "Envelope версии 3 кодирует длину payload как unsigned varint и отклоняет декодированную длину больше 16 MiB до выделения буфера.", "tags": [], "identifiers": ["version 3", "16 MiB", "unsigned varint"], "source_ref": "SRC-BIN-V3"}
{"memory_key": "m17", "id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000000017", "logical_id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000001017", "revision": 1, "supersedes_id": null, "status": "active", "scope": "global", "project_id": null, "memory_type": "procedure", "content": "The compiler plugin assigns synthetic symbol names from a monotonic declaration index after macro expansion, never from process memory addresses.", "tags": [], "identifiers": ["synthetic symbol", "macro expansion"], "source_ref": "SRC-COMP-SYMBOLS"}
{"memory_key": "m18", "id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000000018", "logical_id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000001018", "revision": 1, "supersedes_id": null, "status": "active", "scope": "global", "project_id": null, "memory_type": "procedure", "content": "The field-ingest trace records the received coordinate-array layout in the geojson.position_layout span attribute. This diagnostic attribute observes input only; it does not transform coordinates.", "tags": [], "identifiers": ["geojson.position_layout"], "source_ref": "SRC-GEO-INGEST-DIAGNOSTIC"}
{"memory_key": "m19", "id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000000019", "logical_id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000001019", "revision": 1, "supersedes_id": null, "status": "active", "scope": "global", "project_id": null, "memory_type": "procedure", "content": "For host-to-host font drift, inspect the resolved variable-font axis tuple on the layout span attribute font.axes. The diagnostic reports the chosen axes but supplies no default-value policy.", "tags": [], "identifiers": ["font.axes", "layout span"], "source_ref": "SRC-FONT-AXIS-DIAGNOSTIC"}
{"memory_key": "m20", "id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000000020", "logical_id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000001020", "revision": 1, "supersedes_id": null, "status": "active", "scope": "global", "project_id": null, "memory_type": "decision", "content": "The telemetry collector makes sampling only at the root span; child spans inherit the sampled flag and must not independently flip it.", "tags": [], "identifiers": ["root span", "sampled flag"], "source_ref": "SRC-TRACE-SAMPLING"}
{"memory_key": "m21", "id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000000021", "logical_id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000001021", "revision": 1, "supersedes_id": null, "status": "active", "scope": "global", "project_id": null, "memory_type": "procedure", "content": "For calibration curves, parse measured values from decimal strings; never construct Decimal from a binary float before fitting the curve.", "tags": [], "identifiers": ["Decimal", "binary float"], "source_ref": "SRC-DECIMAL-CALIBRATION"}
{"memory_key": "m22", "id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000000022", "logical_id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000001022", "revision": 1, "supersedes_id": null, "status": "active", "scope": "global", "project_id": null, "memory_type": "procedure", "content": "The calibration importer records the parser selected for each measurement in the measurement.parse_mode diagnostic field. It does not prescribe how numeric values are constructed.", "tags": [], "identifiers": ["measurement.parse_mode"], "source_ref": "SRC-DECIMAL-PARSE-DIAGNOSTIC"}
{"memory_key": "m23", "id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000000023", "logical_id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000001023", "revision": 1, "supersedes_id": null, "status": "active", "scope": "global", "project_id": null, "memory_type": "procedure", "content": "When displaying an identifier, truncate by grapheme clusters and append an ellipsis; slicing UTF-16 code units can split an emoji sequence.", "tags": [], "identifiers": ["grapheme clusters", "UTF-16"], "source_ref": "SRC-UNICODE-DISPLAY"}
{"memory_key": "m24", "id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000000024", "logical_id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000001024", "revision": 1, "supersedes_id": null, "status": "active", "scope": "global", "project_id": null, "memory_type": "policy", "content": "Binary frame decoders validate the fixed 8-byte magic before reading the declared version, so random input cannot select a version parser.", "tags": [], "identifiers": ["8-byte magic", "version parser"], "source_ref": "SRC-BIN-FRAMING"}
{"memory_key": "m25", "id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000000025", "logical_id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000001025", "revision": 1, "supersedes_id": null, "status": "active", "scope": "global", "project_id": null, "memory_type": "decision", "content": "Compiler diagnostic columns are counted in Unicode scalar values, not bytes and not terminal display cells.", "tags": [], "identifiers": ["diagnostic columns", "Unicode scalar"], "source_ref": "SRC-COMP-DIAGNOSTICS"}
{"memory_key": "m26", "id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000000026", "logical_id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000001026", "revision": 1, "supersedes_id": null, "status": "active", "scope": "global", "project_id": null, "memory_type": "procedure", "content": "A geofence point exactly on a boundary is classified inside; polygon rings are closed explicitly, even when the input repeats no final point.", "tags": [], "identifiers": ["geofence", "polygon rings"], "source_ref": "SRC-GEO-FENCE"}
{"memory_key": "m27", "id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000000027", "logical_id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000001027", "revision": 1, "supersedes_id": null, "status": "active", "scope": "global", "project_id": null, "memory_type": "policy", "content": "The line-breaking stage receives glyph advances only after shaping; it must not infer advances directly from character widths.", "tags": [], "identifiers": ["line-breaking", "glyph advances"], "source_ref": "SRC-FONT-LINEBREAK"}
{"memory_key": "m28", "id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000000028", "logical_id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000001028", "revision": 1, "supersedes_id": null, "status": "active", "scope": "global", "project_id": null, "memory_type": "decision", "content": "Span duration is derived from monotonic clock deltas on one process; wall-clock timestamps are used only to place the span on a cross-process timeline.", "tags": [], "identifiers": ["monotonic clock", "span duration"], "source_ref": "SRC-TRACE-CLOCK"}
{"memory_key": "m29", "id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000000029", "logical_id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000001029", "revision": 1, "supersedes_id": null, "status": "active", "scope": "global", "project_id": null, "memory_type": "procedure", "content": "A decimal interval is serialized as two canonical plain-decimal strings, lower then upper; exponent notation is rejected at the protocol boundary.", "tags": [], "identifiers": ["plain-decimal", "interval"], "source_ref": "SRC-DECIMAL-WIRE"}
{"memory_key": "m30", "id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000000030", "logical_id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000001030", "revision": 1, "supersedes_id": null, "status": "active", "scope": "global", "project_id": null, "memory_type": "decision", "content": "A timestamp that lands in a spring-forward gap is invalid for manual scheduling; callers must choose a different local time rather than shifting it automatically.", "tags": [], "identifiers": ["spring-forward gap", "manual scheduling"], "source_ref": "SRC-TIME-GAP"}
{"memory_key": "m31", "id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000000031", "logical_id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000001031", "revision": 1, "supersedes_id": null, "status": "active", "scope": "global", "project_id": null, "memory_type": "policy", "content": "A protocol proxy stores unknown optional TLV extensions in an opaque extension bucket and writes that bucket back unchanged when forwarding the envelope.", "tags": [], "identifiers": ["opaque extension bucket", "TLV"], "source_ref": "SRC-BIN-PROXY-TLV"}
{"memory_key": "m32", "id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000000032", "logical_id": "01990000-0000-7000-8000-000000001032", "revision": 1, "supersedes_id": null, "status": "active", "scope": "global", "project_id": null, "memory_type": "procedure", "content": "The source map generator canonicalizes line endings to LF before calculating generated-line offsets, while preserving original source content separately.", "tags": [], "identifiers": ["source map", "LF"], "source_ref": "SRC-COMP-SOURCEMAP"}
